        <body>
            <div xml:id="d327">

                <pb facs="0355" n="239" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg239"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/517.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-12-14">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">December</hi> 14, 1911</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Senate amendment removing the exception of the judiciary from dismissal has
                    been accepted and the amended bill goes to the President for signature.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
